{"sha": "47c8aa85e1afd371e6dae64e804da9fb8b87d6fda0c35a4e7e16776f367418c7", "body": ["\\begin{proof}", "体积可加：$V = m_lv_l + m_vv_v$；两边除以 $m$。能量、焓与", "熵也都是广延量。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[font=\\small, x=1cm, y=1cm, >=Stealth]", "  \\draw[->] (0,0) -- (9.4,0) node[below] {$v$};", "  \\draw[->] (0,0) -- (0,5.4) node[left] {$P$};", "  % dome", "  \\draw[omDef, thick] plot[smooth, tension=0.8] coordinates {(0.7,0.2) (0.8,2.0) (1.3,3.6) (2.6,4.5) (4.0,3.5) (5.2,2.0) (7.0,1.1) (9.0,0.5)};", "  \\fill (2.6,4.5) circle (2pt) node[above, font=\\footnotesize] {$\\mathrm C$};", "  % isotherm T1 < Tc", "  \\draw[omProp, thick] (0.62,5.0) .. controls (0.7,3.2) .. (0.8,2.0) -- (5.2,2.0)", "        .. controls (6.4,1.6) and (7.6,1.1) .. (9.2,0.85);", "  \\node[omProp, font=\\footnotesize, anchor=west] at (9.0,1.2) {$T_1$};", "  % critical isotherm", "  \\draw[omThm, thick] (1.1,5.3) .. controls (1.8,4.6) and (2.2,4.5) .. (2.6,4.5)", "        .. controls (3.6,4.5) and (5.0,3.4) .. (9.2,2.4);", "  \\node[omThm, font=\\footnotesize, anchor=west] at (9.0,2.7) {$T_c$};", "  % supercritical isotherm", "  \\draw[omExo, thick] (1.7,5.4) .. controls (2.6,4.9) and (4.0,4.4) .. (9.2,3.6);", "  \\node[omExo, font=\\footnotesize, anchor=west] at (9.0,3.9) {$T_2 > T_c$};", "  % lever", "  \\fill (0.8,2.0) circle (1.6pt) node[above left, font=\\footnotesize] {$L$};", "  \\fill (5.2,2.0) circle (1.6pt) node[above right, font=\\footnotesize] {$V$};", "  \\fill (2.5,2.0) circle (1.6pt) node[above, font=\\footnotesize] {$M$};", "  \\draw[<->, omDef] (0.8,1.55) -- (2.5,1.55) node[midway, below, font=\\footnotesize] {$x\\,(v_v - v_l)$};", "  \\draw[<->, omDef] (2.5,1.55) -- (5.2,1.55) node[midway, below, font=\\footnotesize] {$(1 - x)(v_v - v_l)$};", "  \\draw[dashed] (0.8,2.0) -- (0.8,0) node[below, font=\\footnotesize] {$v_l$};", "  \\draw[dashed] (5.2,2.0) -- (5.2,0) node[below, font=\\footnotesize] {$v_v$};", "  \\draw[dashed] (2.5,2.0) -- (2.5,0) node[below, font=\\footnotesize] {$v$};", "  \\node[font=\\footnotesize, rotate=90] at (0.3,3.4) {液体};", "  \\node[font=\\footnotesize] at (3.7,0.6) {液体 + 蒸气};", "  \\node[font=\\footnotesize] at (7.6,0.25) {蒸气};", "  \\draw[dashed] (0,2.0) node[left, font=\\footnotesize] {$P_s(T_1)$} -- (0.8,2.0);", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 克拉珀龙图上的安德鲁斯等温线。穹顶之下的", "等温线 $T_1$ 在 $P_s(T_1)$ 处为一平台；其上的状态点 $M$ 为一种", "混合态，其蒸气分数 $x$ 为比值 $LM/LV$。临界", "等温线在顶点处与穹顶相切，且拐点水平；", "高于 $T_c$ 时既无平台，", "也无液体与气体之分。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{example}[水壶与锅炉]\\label{ex:b1:phase-changes:lever}", "水在 \\qty{100}{\\degreeCelsius}、\\qty{1}{atm} 下：$v_l = \\qty{1.04e-3}{m^3/kg}$，", "$v_v = \\qty{1.67}{m^3/kg}$ --- 比值为 $1600$。一个密闭的 \\qty{1.0}{L}", "容器中盛有该温度下的 \\qty{0.50}{kg} 水，其 $v =", "\\qty{2.0e-3}{m^3/kg}$，且 $x = (2.0 - 1.04) \\times 10^{-3}/1.67 = 5.8 \\times 10^{-4}$：", "\\qty{0.29}{g} 的蒸气占据容器的一半。密闭容器中将蒸气", "质量加倍几乎不改变状态点；压强", "仅由温度决定。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\section{相变的能量学}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[相变的潜热、焓与熵]\\label{prop:b1:phase-changes:latent}", "\\index{相变焓}\\index{相变熵}", "在共存的温度 $T$ 与压强 $P_s(T)$ 下，由相 1 到相 2 的", "单位质量的相变过程是可逆的、", "等温、等压，且", "\\[", "L_{12}(T) = h_2 - h_1 , \\qquad s_2 - s_1 = \\frac{L_{12}}{T} , \\qquad", "u_2 - u_1 = L_{12} - P_s(v_2 - v_1) .", "\\]", "$L_{12} > 0$，即向较无序的相转变（熔化、", "汽化、升华），且 $L_{21} = -L_{12}$。水在 \\qty{1}{atm} 下：", "$L_f = \\qty{334}{kJ/kg}$，在 \\qty{0}{\\degreeCelsius} 时；$L_v = \\qty{2257}{kJ/kg}$，在", "\\qty{100}{\\degreeCelsius} 时。", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "定压下所吸收的热量为 $\\Delta H$", "（见\\cref{prop:b1:first-law:qvqp}）；若可逆且等温，则其值为", "$T\\Delta S$（见\\cref{prop:b1:second-law-entropy:identity}）；并有 $U = H - PV$。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{example}[汽化热的去向]\\label{ex:b1:phase-changes:whereheat}", "水在 \\qty{100}{\\degreeCelsius} 下：$P_s(v_v - v_l) = 1.013 \\times 10^5 \\times", "1.67 = \\qty{169}{kJ/kg}$，故 $u_v - u_l = 2257 - 169 = \\qty{2088}{kJ/kg}$：", "潜热的 $93\\%$ 用于将分子拉开，$7\\%$", "用于把大气推回。", "汽化熵 $2257/373 = \\qty{6.05}{kJ/(kg.K)}$，远大于熔化熵 $334/273 =", "\\qty{1.22}{kJ/(kg.K)}$：熔化使分子松动，沸腾则使分子脱离束缚。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\begin{method}[含相变的量热法]\\label{meth:b1:phase-changes:calorimetry}", "在定压绝热容器中，$\\sum\\Delta H_i = 0$。先猜测", "终态（存在哪些相、处于何温度）；", "将各物体的 $\\Delta H$ 写为显热 $mc\\,\\Delta T$ 加上潜热", "$\\pm mL$（依所经历的变化取正负）之和；求解；\\emph{检验", "猜测}：若某物体终温高于沸点或低于", "熔点，或某一相的质量为负，说明猜测有误 --- 此时终态", "为相变温度下的混合物，", "未知量即为发生相变的质量（见\\cref{ex:b1:first-law:ice}）。", "\\end{method}", "", "\\begin{example}[蒸汽烫伤]\\label{ex:b1:phase-changes:steam}", "\\qty{10}{g} 温度为 \\qty{100}{\\degreeCelsius} 的蒸汽在皮肤上凝结时，", "在降温一度之前即放出 $0.010 \\times 2257 = \\qty{22.6}{kJ}$ ---", "相当于 \\qty{10}{g} 沸水降温", "\\qty{540}{K} 时所放出的热量。这正是蒸汽烫伤远比", "同温度的水严重，也解释了为何蒸汽散热器只需很小的质量流量。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[font=\\small, x=1cm, y=1cm, >=Stealth]", "  \\draw[->] (0,0) -- (9.0,0) node[below] {$s$};", "  \\draw[->] (0,0) -- (0,5.2) node[left] {$T$};", "  \\draw[omDef, thick] (0.9,0.3) .. controls (1.3,2.6) and (2.6,4.4) .. (4.0,4.6)", "        .. controls (5.4,4.4) and (7.0,2.4) .. (8.4,0.3);", "  \\fill (4.0,4.6) circle (2pt) node[above, font=\\footnotesize] {$\\mathrm C$};", "  % isobar at T1", "  \\draw[omProp, thick] (0.6,0.35) .. controls (1.1,1.2) .. (1.65,2.6) -- (6.65,2.6)", "        .. controls (7.4,3.0) and (8.0,3.6) .. (8.6,4.5);", "  \\node[omProp, font=\\footnotesize, anchor=west] at (8.6,4.6) {等压线 $P_1$};", "  \\draw[dashed] (1.65,2.6) -- (1.65,0) node[below, font=\\footnotesize] {$s_l$};", "  \\draw[dashed] (6.65,2.6) -- (6.65,0) node[below, font=\\footnotesize] {$s_v$};", "  \\draw[dashed] (0,2.6) node[left, font=\\footnotesize] {$T_1$} -- (1.65,2.6);", "  \\draw[<->, omThm] (1.65,2.9) -- (6.65,2.9) node[midway, above, font=\\footnotesize] {$s_v - s_l = L_v/T_1$};", "  \\fill[omThm!15] (1.65,0) rectangle (6.65,2.6);", "  \\node[font=\\footnotesize, omThm] at (4.15,1.2) {面积 $= L_v$};", "  \\node[font=\\footnotesize] at (1.0,3.9) {液体};", "  \\node[font=\\footnotesize] at (8.3,1.9) {蒸气};", "  \\node[font=\\footnotesize] at (4.15,2.0) {液体 + 蒸气};", "\\end{tikzpicture}", ""]}